          <title>5 WARNINGS AND PRECAUTIONS</title>
          <text><paragraph>Ibuprofen is mentioned here but this is not the interactions section.</paragraph></text>
        </section>
      </component>
      <component>
        <section ID="S7">
          <code code="34073-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DRUG INTERACTIONS SECTION"/>
          <title>7 DRUG INTERACTIONS</title>
          <excerpt>
            <highlight>
              <text><list><item>Highlights item about ibuprofen that must be skipped.</item></list></text>
            </highlight>
          </excerpt>
          <component>
            <section ID="S7.1">
              <code code="42229-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="SPL UNCLASSIFIED SECTION"/>
              <title>7.1 General Information</title>
              <text>
                <paragraph>Drugs may interact with warfarin sodium through pharmacodynamic or pharmacokinetic mechanisms.</paragraph>
              </text>
            </section>
          </component>
          <component>
            <section ID="S7.3">
              <code code="42229-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="SPL UNCLASSIFIED SECTION"/>
              <title>7.3 Drugs that Increase Bleeding Risk</title>
              <text>
                <paragraph>Examples of drugs known to increase the risk of bleeding are presented in Table 2.</paragraph>
                <table>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr><td>Antiplatelet Agents</td><td>aspirin, cilostazol, clopidogrel</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Nonsteroidal Anti-Inflammatory Agents</td><td>celecoxib, diclofenac, <content styleCode="bold">ibuprofen</content>, naproxen</td></tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </text>
            </section>
          </component>
          <component>
            <section ID="S7.4">
              <code code="42229-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="SPL UNCLASSIFIED SECTION"/>
              <title>7.4 Clinically Significant Drug Interactions</title>
              <text>
                <table>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr><td colspan="2">Strong CYP3A4 inhibitors</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Clinical Impact:</td><td>Increased exposure.</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Examples:</td><td>clarithromycin, ketoconazole</td></tr>
                    <tr><td colspan="2">Grapefruit juice</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>Intervention:</td><td>Avoid large quantities.</td></tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </text>
            </section>
          </component>
        </section>
      </component>
